{'symbol': 'PYPL', 'date': '2019-11-20 19:30:00', 'title': 'PAYPAL TO ACQUIRE HONEY', 'text': "PAYPAL TO ACQUIRE HONEY.PAYPAL HOLDINGS INC - DEAL FOR APPROXIMATELY $4 BILLION.PAYPAL HOLDINGS INC - ACQUISITION IS EXPECTED TO BE ACCRETIVE TO PAYPAL'S NON-GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE IN 2021.PAYPAL HOLDINGS INC - HONEY WAS PROFITABLE ON A NET INCOME BASIS IN 2018.PAYPAL HOLDINGS INC - FOLLOWING ACQUISITION, HONEY WILL RETAIN ITS HEADQUARTERS AND BRAND IN LOS ANGELES, CALIFORNIA.PAYPAL HOLDINGS INC - AGREED TO ACQUIRE HONEY SCIENCE CORPORATION, A TECHNOLOGY PLATFORM FOR SHOPPING AND REWARDS.PAYPAL HOLDINGS - HONEY CO-FOUNDERS GEORGE RUAN AND RYAN HUDSON WILL CONTINUE TO LEAD HONEY TEAM FOLLOWING THE ACQUISITION."}
{'symbol': 'PFE', 'date': '2019-11-20 22:30:00', 'title': 'VIIV HEALTHCARE ANNOUNCES EXCLUSIVE LICENSING AGREEMENT WITH THE NATIONAL INSTITUTES OF HEALTH FOR INVESTIGATIONAL “BNAB” WITH POTENTIAL FOR LONG-ACTING HIV TREATMENT AND PREVENTION', 'text': 'VIIV HEALTHCARE WITH PFIZER INC. AND SHIONOGI LIMITED AS SHAREHOLDERS, ANNOUNCED THAT THE COMPANY WILL BE DEVELOPING THE INVESTIGATIONAL BROADLY NEUTRALISING ANTIBODY (BNAB) N6LS FOR THE TREATMENT AND PREVENTION OF HIV-1, AS PART OF AN EXCLUSIVE LICENSING AGREEMENT BETWEEN GSK AND THE NATIONAL INSTITUTE OF ALLERGY AND INFECTIOUS DISEASES (NIAID), PART OF THE NATIONAL INSTITUTES OF HEALTH (NIH). BROADLY NEUTRALISING ANTIBODIES ARE ANTIBODIES THAT CAN RECOGNISE AND BLOCK THE ENTRY OF DIFFERENT STRAINS OF HIV INTO HEALTHY CELLS. N6LS IS AN ANTIVIRAL BNAB THAT WORKS BY BINDING TO A SPECIFIC SITE (GP120) ON THE SURFACE OF HIV THAT PREVENTS ITS ENTRY INTO UNINFECTED IMMUNE SYSTEM CELLS (CD4+ T-CELLS). BY BLOCKING HIV’S ENTRY INTO HUMAN CD4+ CELLS, HIV REPLICATION IS HALTED, AND THE HIV TRANSMISSION PROCESS MAY BE PREVENTED.'}
